window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Nicholi’s world goes up in flames when soldiers invade his country, leaving chaos in their wake. Captured and enslaved in a foreign land, Nicholi struggles to cope with the nightmare of slavery and adapt to the terrifying and inexplicable world he is thrust into. </p> <p>He draws courage from a steadfast determination to get justice for his murdered family and—he hopes—inner peace by finding and killing the man responsible for the destruction of his village. Yet, through it all, Nicholi’s greatest enemy might not be foreign powers, enemy soldiers, or the self-serving machinations of his fellow slaves, but himself.</p>"; 
